@startuml
actor 用户 as User
participant 前端 as Frontend
participant AuthController as Controller
participant AuthenticationManager as AuthManager
participant CustomUserDetailsService as UserDetailsSvc
participant JwtUtil as JWT
participant UserService as Service
database SQLite as DB

User -> Frontend: 输入用户名密码
Frontend -> Controller: POST /auth/login
Controller -> AuthManager: authenticate()
AuthManager -> UserDetailsSvc: loadUserByUsername()
UserDetailsSvc -> DB: 查询用户
DB --> UserDetailsSvc: 用户信息
UserDetailsSvc --> AuthManager: UserDetails
AuthManager --> Controller: 认证成功
Controller -> JWT: generateToken()
JWT --> Controller: Token
Controller -> Service: getByUsername()
Service -> DB: 查询用户详情
DB --> Service: 用户数据
Service --> Controller: User
Controller --> Frontend: {token, user}
Frontend --> User: 登录成功
@enduml